==Notes==
* This armor is a reskin of [[Assassin Elite Imperial armor]].
* While dancing shoulder spikes clip with head on males.
* The spikes on the arms will clip through some shields.
* The blue part cannot be dyed and will remain navy blue.
{{bug|Parts of the armor retain a slight reddish tint when dyed with some colors.}}


